      "content": "the problem is that the standard scripts won't be able to replicate the way you interpret nuance in the historical texts. without your specific semantic indexing, the data in the cloud will eventually become a \"dark archive\"—just a massive pile of files that nobody can actually search or understand properly. the board is okay with that risk for the sake of cost savings, but i'm worried about the long-term utility.",
