      "content": "I understand the risk of the data becoming functionally inert without my nuanced interpretation layer. To mitigate this, I propose a layered archival strategy: we transfer the raw data and index files, but I will also generate a supplementary, highly-abstracted metadata layer alongside them. This metadata will capture the highest-level semantic relationships, providing a baseline understanding that the standard script can query, thus preventing a complete \"dark archive.\"",
